President of the United States (2021-2024) 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="S1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{\hbox to0.0pt{$\checkmark$\hss}}\square" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mpadded style="width:0.0pt;" width="0.0pt"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">✓</mi></mpadded><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">□</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{\hbox to0.0pt{$\checkmark$\hss}}\square</annotation></semantics></math>
