<div id="S3.SS2.SSS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.SS2.SSS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To form TLQA, we construct a question that explicitly requests a list of entities or facts with corresponding time periods associated with the entities. The question templates for infobox types can be seen in Table <a href="#S3.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 3.2.5. TLQA from infoboxes ‣ 3.2. TLQA generation ‣ 3. Benchmark Creation ‣ Evaluating List Construction and Temporal Understanding capabilities of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>. </span><span id="S3.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fields for temporal information from Infoboxes</span></figcaption>
<div id="S3.T2.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:180.5pt;height:84.2pt;vertical-align:-40.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-22.6pt,10.5pt) scale(0.8,0.8) ;">
