<span id="S3.T2.5.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.5.1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">List all teams <em id="S3.T2.5.1.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">&lt;subject&gt;</em> played for to this day.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
