<span id="S5.T9.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Query</span>: <span id="S5.T9.5.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">List all political positions Ulf Kristersson held to this day.</span> <span id="S5.T9.5.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Incomplete Answer Error</span></span></td></tr>
